to the Ray task that runs a trial, and pathspec in the agent's venv. Cherry-pick of swiss-ai/nemo-gym
85f6def4a (Konstantinos Pitas), branch swissai/harbor_agent_osb_v0.7.0, as Robert ran it on KISTI
(rl-infra branch harbor-osb).

